# This volume is PARTIALLY checked in: only the curated configuration below lives in git,
# everything else (runtime state, databases, caches, secrets) stays local-only. The agent
# writes a lot of state here at runtime (sessions/, state.db, gateway.lock, ...) and even
# unpacks its stock skills into skills/ on startup — hence a whitelist instead of a blocklist.
# Secrets (.env) never go to git.
*
!.gitignore
!.env.example
!config.yaml
!SOUL.md
# Only our own skill is curated; the stock skills Hermes unpacks at startup stay out.
!skills/
skills/*
!skills/transbrain-api/
!skills/transbrain-api/**
